% adapted from https://latex.us/macros/latex/contrib/biblatex-contrib/biblatex-nature/nature.bbx
% https://tex.stackexchange.com/questions/527274/modify-bibtex-style-in-usepackagestyle-naturebiblatex

%% ---------------------------------------------------------------
%% biblatex-nature --- A biblatex implementation of the Nature
